hts in the comments  below both of these games are available  from March the 5th which is a Tuesday by  the way ok so now I'd usually be talking  about ps3 and Vita games but we know  they're not here anymore  and it does not look like they're going  to be replaced any time  I am truly gutted how do you feel about  it I was certain a psvr title would be  added but alas it isn't to be on the  plus side apex legends has a few skins  and banners for you to download on your  ps4 and ps4 also receives Red Dead  Redemption online early access on  clothing emotes and weaponry over this  month the jawbone knife and over 150 new  pieces of attire to help you stand out  from the other outlaws in future videos  I'll be sure to break down all the  hidden PS plus extras but for now I bid  you farewell thanks for your time  hopefully I'll see you again soon  [Music]

